OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies in crash with
OL,4,Acar on major road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in a crash involving a
OL,7,Fcar and a motorbike in Leicester.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police were called to
OL,10,Freports of a collision involving a red
OL,11,FTesla Model 3 and grey Kawasaki ZX10
OL,12,Fmotorcycle in Narborough Road South at
OL,13,F14:40 BST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe motorcyclist ` a man in his 50s `
OL,16,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene, the
OL,17,Fforce said. No arrests have been made.
OL,19,FA section of the road was closed for
OL,20,Fseveral hours, near the junction of
OL,21,FFosse Park Avenue, but has since
OL,22,Freopened.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
